WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:21,550
Mom, son, I'm sorry for being unfilial. You, I'm sorry, dad.

2
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:22,710
I'm even more sorry Tingting

3
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:24,030
Go in peace

4
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:25,550
I will take good care of Tingting

5
00:00:25,910 --> 00:00:26,990
I'll let her go to college

6
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,190
Let her find a good job

7
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,390
Watch her get married and start a family

8
00:00:30,150 --> 00:00:32,420
I will definitely avenge you and dad.

9
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,750
People who bullied you

10
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:35,830
Don't even think about running away

11
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:45,570
Go and deal with it for her

12
00:00:46,050 --> 00:01:08,440
what do you want to do

13
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:09,600
What do you think we are going to do?

14
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:10,920
It's up to you to follow us

15
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,160
Or should I ask someone to take you away?

16
00:01:13,750 --> 00:01:16,350
I'll go find you after I finish taking care of my mother's affairs.

17
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:18,300
Now please get out of the way

18
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:21,600
I'm going to take her to the funeral home.

19
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:22,680
People and cars are at the scene

20
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:28,930
I haven't made my identity clear yet, so I can't let her go. Why should I let her go?

21
00:01:28,930 --> 00:01:30,170
Captain Li, you want her to go

22
00:01:30,170 --> 00:01:32,370
Yes, let her go. Let her go to the funeral home first.

23
00:01:32,370 --> 00:01:33,290
buried her mother

24
00:01:33,770 --> 00:01:35,130
I believe that after she is done with it

25
00:01:35,290 --> 00:01:37,250
If she runs away, she will come to me on her own

26
00:01:37,250 --> 00:01:38,810
Who will bear this responsibility for me?

27
00:01:39,170 --> 00:01:40,090
I let her go

28
00:01:40,210 --> 00:01:43,090
All responsibilities are borne by me personally and have nothing to do with you. The team is closed.

29
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:46,000
I'll give you one day to deal with the funeral affairs

30
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:47,440
Come to the security brigade tomorrow

31
00:01:47,880 --> 00:01:49,480
Let us help you contact the funeral home's car

32
00:01:49,480 --> 00:01:50,680
No, I'll help her go

33
00:01:50,680 --> 00:02:05,430
I want to send her in person and tell me

34
00:02:05,430 --> 00:02:07,630
Who is the one who beats your mother?
